keep this in mind:  Vlad's towers are located in hell.  all the levels
in hell only have up stairwells!  however, Vlad's inner chambers can be
climbed up and down from the inside using the up/down ladders.  the
inner chambers cannot be entered into _normally_ except for the deepest
one which has a secret hidden door.  there are 3 tower levels.  so the
normal way to navigate the towers is to start on the deepest one and
map all 3 inner chambers and whatever and then continue to map the outside
of the deepest tower level and then map the outside of the next level
after going up the only up _stairwell_.  remember that in hell you can
only go down by level teleporting ...

